{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Goal
    
    Create a scroll-driven step section where the left side auto-highlights steps based on scroll position, similar to WHOOP’s “How it works”.
    
    Desktop Layout
    
    Two columns:
    
    Left: Step indicator (sticky)
    
    Right: Step content (vertical scroll)
    
    Left Column (Steps)
    
    Sticky while this section is in view
    
    Shows a vertical list of step titles
    
    Automatically updates active state on scroll
    
    No click interaction required
    
    Active step:
    
    Highlighted text
    
    Vertical indicator line
    
    Inactive steps:
    
    Reduced opacity
    
    Right Column (Content)
    
    Vertical list of step sections
    
    Each step contains:
    
    Headline
    
    Description
    
    Image or video
    
    Each step section height ~80–100vh (recommended)
    
    Scroll Behavior
    
    Use IntersectionObserver (or equivalent)
    
    When a step’s content enters the viewport center (≈40–60%):
    
    Mark that step as active
    
    Update left-side highlight
    
    Optional: fade / slight translate animation on first enter
    
    Mobile
    
    Disable left sticky column
    
    Stack steps vertically (title + content)
    
    Keep simple scroll-in animations
    
    Shopify / CMS
    
    Build as a reusable Shopify Section
    
    Steps as repeatable blocks
    
    Editable fields per step:
    
    Step title
    
    Headline
    
    Description
    
    Image / video
    
    Order configurable in admin
    
    Important Notes
    
    ❌ No tabs
    
    ❌ No click-only interaction
    
    ✅ Scroll-driven state only
    
    ✅ Left side is a progress indicator, not navigation, Auto-Play Behavior (Core)
    
    Steps auto-advance on a timer:
    
    Default interval: 7s (acceptable range 5–10s)
    
    Loop back to Step 1 after last step
    
    When step changes:
    
    Left active step highlight updates
    
    Right content (image/video + text) updates
    
    Use a simple transition (fade / slight slide) Everything else remains unchanged, and the font should be consistent with the font used in the theme application., Goal
    
    Build a “How it works” section where the left step progress automatically advances every ~5–10 seconds (no user interaction needed). The right content updates in sync.
    
    Desktop Layout
    
    Two columns:
    
    Left: Step list + progress indicator (sticky)
    
    Right: Media + copy for the active step
    
    Auto-Play Behavior (Core)
    
    Steps auto-advance on a timer:
    
    Default interval: 7s (acceptable range 5–10s)
    
    Loop back to Step 1 after last step
    
    When step changes:
    
    Left active step highlight updates
    
    Right content (image/video + text) updates
    
    Use a simple transition (fade / slight slide)
    
    Left Column (No Interaction)
    
    No click, no hover required
    
    Shows step titles vertically
    
    Active step:
    
    Highlighted
    
    Animated progress line/bar that fills during the interval
    
    Inactive steps:
    
    Reduced opacity
    
    When progress completes → advance to next step
    
    Optional (Nice-to-have, not required)
    
    Pause auto-play when:
    
    Section not in viewport (use IntersectionObserver)
    
    User has prefers-reduced-motion: reduce
    
    Resume when back in view
    
    Mobile
    
    Simplify to a vertical stack or swipe carousel
    
    Auto-advance can remain, but keep animations minimal
    
    Shopify / CMS
    
    Build as a reusable Shopify Section
    
    Steps as repeatable blocks
    
    Editable fields per step:
    
    Step title
    
    Headline
    
    Description
    
    Image / video
    
    Global settings:
    
    Autoplay on/off
    
    Interval (seconds)
    
    Important Notes
    
    This is timer-driven autoplay, not tabs, not scroll-driven.
    
    Left side is a progress indicator, not navigation., Goal
    
    Create a “How it works” section where steps auto-advance every 5–10s with a progress bar, and users can click step titles to jump to a specific step. Colors must be configurable (progress bar + entire section theme).
    
    Desktop Layout
    
    Two columns:
    
    Left: Step titles + progress indicator (sticky)
    
    Right: Active step content (headline, description, image/video)
    
    Core Interaction Logic
    1) Autoplay (default ON)
    
    Interval setting: 5–10 seconds (default 7s)
    
    Progress bar fills during the interval
    
    When progress completes → advance to next step
    
    Loop after last step
    
    2) Click-to-Jump (left titles)
    
    Clicking a step title immediately activates that step and updates right content
    
    On click:
    
    Reset progress bar to 0 and restart timer for the selected step
    
    Optional setting: “Resume autoplay after click” (default ON)
    
    3) Pause/Resume Rules (recommended)
    
    Pause autoplay when section is out of viewport (IntersectionObserver)
    
    Respect prefers-reduced-motion: reduce (disable autoplay / minimize animation)
    
    Visual Behavior
    
    Step change transition: fade or subtle slide (300–600ms)
    
    Active step styling:
    
    Highlighted text
    
    Progress indicator visible/animated
    
    Inactive steps:
    
    Reduced opacity
    
    Shopify / CMS Structure
    
    Build as a reusable Shopify Section with repeatable Step blocks.
    
    Step block fields
    
    Step title (left)
    
    Headline (right)
    
    Description (right)
    
    Image or video (right)
    
    Global section settings (must-have)
    
    Autoplay toggle (on/off)
    
    Interval (seconds)
    
    Loop toggle (on/off)
    
    Color Customization (must-have)
    
    Provide Shopify theme settings to control:
    
    Section-level colors
    
    Background color
    
    Primary text color
    
    Secondary text color (inactive steps / body copy)
    
    Progress indicator colors
    
    Progress bar color (active fill)
    
    Progress track color (inactive track)
    
    Optional:
    
    Border/indicator line color
    
    Card/media overlay color (if used)
    
    Implementation suggestion:
    
    Use CSS variables set from section settings (e.g. --bg, --text, --muted, --progress, --track)
    
    Mobile
    
    Stack vertically or use a simple carousel
    
    Click/tap still works
    
    Autoplay optional (can inherit desktop setting)
    
    Notes
    
    This is autoplay-first but clickable.
    
    Avoid building as tabs only; it must include the timer + progress fill behavior., Expected
    
    On mobile, the progress indicator should be a thin line:
    
    A track line (background line) is always visible
    
    A fill line sits on top and grows in width
    
    It should not become a solid block/rectangle 其他保持不变
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.inactive {
    opacity: {{ block.settings.inactive_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.progress_track_color }};
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 3px;
    height: 0;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.progress_bar_color }};
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: height 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    animation: ai-how-it-works-fill-{{ ai_gen_id }} var(--ai-how-it-works-duration-{{ ai_gen_id }}) linear forwards;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active.paused .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  }

  @keyframes ai-how-it-works-fill-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    from {
      height: 0;
    }
    to {
      height: 100%;
    }
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.completed::before {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.progress_bar_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.completed .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 100%;
    animation: none;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.nav_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-how-it-works-nav-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.active_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease, visibility 0.5s;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: translateY(0);
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.media_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.media_background }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} img,
  .ai-how-it-works-step-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} video {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.media_background }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.media_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      animation: none;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, visibility 0.2s;
      transform: none;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      position: relative;
      top: auto;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 20px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      min-width: fit-content;
      white-space: nowrap;
      position: relative;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      top: auto;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 2px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: 0;
      top: auto;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      animation: ai-how-it-works-fill-horizontal-{{ ai_gen_id }} var(--ai-how-it-works-duration-{{ ai_gen_id }}) linear forwards;
    }

    @keyframes ai-how-it-works-fill-horizontal-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      from {
        width: 0;
      }
      to {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.completed::before {
      background-color: {{ block.settings.progress_bar_color }};
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.completed .ai-how-it-works-progress-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      animation: none;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 400px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_font_size | times: 0.75 }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-nav-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.nav_font_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} 
  class="ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }}" 
  data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay_enabled }}"
  data-interval="{{ block.settings.autoplay_interval }}"
  data-loop="{{ block.settings.loop_enabled }}"
  data-resume-after-click="{{ block.settings.resume_after_click }}"
  data-pause-out-of-view="{{ block.settings.pause_out_of_view }}"
  data-pause-reduced-motion="{{ block.settings.pause_reduced_motion }}"
  style="--ai-how-it-works-duration-{{ ai_gen_id }}: {{ block.settings.autoplay_interval }}s;"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
